<map version="1.0.1"><node TEXT="Inventaria-Thesaurus"><node TEXT="Aktivitäten" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000001</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000001</p><p>Definition: Dieser Term beinhaltet Typen intentioneller Aktionen, die in der Erhaltung, Herstellung, Modifikation oder Zerstörung einer Entität (Lebewesen; konzeptionelle/materielle Objekte; Gruppen; soziale, intellektuelle, physische Phänomene usw.) resultieren.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Funktionen" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000013</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000013</p><p>Definition: This term classifies activities that are structural parts of a relatively stable complex system of permanent and self-contained procedures that repeat themselves within this system and thus contribute to its preservation. Although functions are part of a wider system, each function is completely distinct from the rest. As structural parts of a complex system, functions are actions that play a certain role within a system and aim at a specific goal, which they must accomplish. In this respect it is not possible that the purpose which a certain function has to achieve is different from that for which the function is performed. In other words, the purpose of a function is one of its identity criteria. Consequently, the notion of the function univocally relates the actions performed and the target achieved by these actions in such a way that, if some other target is achieved due to external factors, we speak of a different function or activity.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;governance&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Ereignistyp" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000044"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000044</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000044</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Ausleihe" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000052"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000052</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000052</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Erstellung des Inventars" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000045"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000045</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000045</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Erstellung eines beigelegten Briefes" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000046"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000046</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000046</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Erweiterung des Inventars" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000048"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000048</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000048</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventarisierung einer Objektklasse" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000050"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000050</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000050</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventarisierung eines Objektes" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000051"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000051</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000051</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventarisierung eines Raums" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000049"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000049</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000049</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Versand" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000053"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000053</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000053</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="Handlungen" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000026"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000026</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000026</p><p>Definition: In den Inventaren genannte Handlungen an Objekten oder Räumen (besichtigen, finden, versiegeln, kaufen …).</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="ansehen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0001</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0001</p><p>Spellings (1): angesehen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="antworten" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0002"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0002</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0002</p><p>Spellings (1): geanburt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="aufschneiden" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0003</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0003</p><p>Spellings (2): auff gesnitten, auffgeschriben</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="beschauen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0004</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0004</p><p>Spellings (2): beschawt worden, beschawt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="besichtigen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0005"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0005</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0005</p><p>Spellings (1): besicht</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="finden" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0006</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0006</p><p>Spellings (3): hat man funden, funden, gefunden</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="geben" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0007"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0007</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0007</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="hängend" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0008"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0008</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0008</p><p>Spellings (1): hangenden</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="kaufen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0009"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0009</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0009</p><p>Spellings (1): zekawffen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="kosten" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0010"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0010</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0010</p><p>Spellings (1): gestet</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="legen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0011</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0011</p><p>Spellings (1): gelegt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="mauern" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0013</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0013</p><p>Spellings (1): zumawren</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="schaffen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0014"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0014</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0014</p><p>Spellings (1): geschaffen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="schlagen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0015"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0015</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0015</p><p>Spellings (1): slagt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="verschlagen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0018"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0018</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0018</p><p>Spellings (1): verslagen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="versiegeln" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0019</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0019</p><p>Spellings (1): ver bettschafft</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="wässern" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0020"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0020</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0020</p><p>Spellings (1): zu wassern</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="Menschliche Interaktionen" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000011</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000011</p><p>Definition: Ce terme désigne les activités menées par au moins un acteur causant ou changeant un phénomène ou une situation au niveau social, politique, financier, culturel ou intellectuel.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;social events, confrontations or conflicts&quot;, &quot;political&quot;, &quot;social and economic occurrences&quot;, &quot;group management&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Entstehungskontext" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000006</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000006</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Ausstattung" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000034"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000034</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000034</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Besitzerwechsel" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000033"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000033</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000033</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Erbschaft/Nachlass" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000035"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000035</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000035</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventarisierung nach Belagerung" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000036"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000036</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000036</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Mangelinventar" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000037"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000037</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000037</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Objekttransfer" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000039"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000039</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000039</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="PflegerInwechsel" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000040"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000040</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000040</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="VerwalterInwechsel" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000041"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000041</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000041</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Zuwachsinventar" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000038"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000038</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000038</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node></node><node TEXT="Konzeptionelle Objekte" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000006</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000006</p><p>Definition: Ce terme désigne les objets dont l’essence reste la même quel qu’en soit le support. Ce sont des produits de l’activité humaine qui s’appuient sur l’utilisation de procédés techniques ou électroniques (photo numérique, mesures géométriques) or non (concepts, pensée). Le fait qu’ils soient matériels ne détermine pas leur identité. Les objets conceptuels ont la capacité à exister sur plus d’un seul support en même temps (photos, mémoire humaine, papier, signaux électroniques) sans que cela change leur identité. Au contraire toute modification de l’objet conceptuel (révision, recadrage) change la définition de son identité.
Les objets conceptuels existent tant qu’on peut les trouver sur au moins un support (y compris la mémoire humaine). Leur existence se termine quand le dernier support et la dernière mémoire sont perdus.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Aussageobjekte" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000022"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000022</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000022</p><p>Definition: Este conceito classifica conteúdos mentais produzidos pela atividade humana, representando dados de realidades físicas, lógicas, psicológicas ou mesmo fictícias. Estes objetos, embora expressos pelo uso de símbolos, não dependem deles, facto que permite a sua transcrição para outro conjunto de símbolos. No entanto, um objeto proposicional às vezes não pode ser diferenciado dos símbolos utilizados (por exemplo, um poema).

Exemplos de conceitos subordinados: “objetos de informação”, “partes estruturais de objetos de informação”.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;information objects&quot;,&quot;structural parts of information objects&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Inventartyp" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000001</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000001</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="personenbezogen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000008"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000008</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000008</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="raumbezogen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000009"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000009</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000009</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="sekundäre Erweiterung" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000054"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000054</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000054</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Teilinventar" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000010"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000010</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000010</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Urbar" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000011</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000011</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="Kommunikationssysteme (Sprache)" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000064"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 0000064</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000064</p><p>Definition: Ο όρος αναφέρεται στους διαύλους μεταφοράς νοημάτων και μηνυμάτων από έναν πομπό σε έναν παραλήπτη, μέσω της χρήσης αμοιβαίως κατανοητών σημείων, σημάτων, εικόνων και σημειωτικών κανόνων. Ως πομπός και παραλήπτης νοούνται τα άτομα ή οι ομάδες που συμμετέχουν στην πράξη της επικοινωνίας. Τα βασικά στάδια της επικοινωνίας, τα οποία χαρακτηρίζουν εγγενώς κάθε σύστημα επικοινωνίας, είναι τα ακόλουθα: (a) η ύπαρξη επικοινωνιακού σκοπού/στόχου, (b) η σύνθεση του μηνύματος, (c) η κωδικοποίηση του μηνύματος, (d) η μετάδοση του μηνύματος ως ακολουθία σημείων/σημάτων διά μέσου ενός συγκεκριμένου διαύλου επικοινωνίας, (e) η λήψη των σημάτων και η εκ νέου σύστασή/συγκρότησή τους σε μήνυμα εκ μέρους του αποδέκτη, (f) η αποκωδικοποίηση του εκ νέου συστημένου/συγκροτημένου μηνύματος και (g) η κατανόηση κι η ερμηνεία του του θεωρούμενου ως αρχικού μηνύματος</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Sprache" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000007"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000007</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000007</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Frühneuhochdeutsch" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000042"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000042</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000042</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Latein" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000043"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000043</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000043</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="Konzepte" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000024"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000024</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000024</p><p>Definition: This term classifies concepts for use in categorizing and/ or systematizing aspects of our perceptible reality. These concept types express fundamental ways of viewing reality and are drawn from different conceptual contexts, each expressing a particular standpoint. They arise from the discussion and comparison of the formulation, definition and use of concepts in different disciplines. They are thus, among other things, meant to play a kind of mediating role between various disciplines and are proposed towards the end of establishing a common inter-disciplinary and inter-thematic conceptual framework.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;identity&quot;,&quot;social identity&quot;,&quot;gender identity&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Eigenschaften und Zustände" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000018"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000018</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000018</p><p>Definition: Qualitative Angaben zu Objekten in den Inventaren (Alter, Zustand, Form, Füllstand, Bewertung, Beschaffenheit).</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Alter und Erhaltungszustand" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000019</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000019</p><p>Definition: Angaben zu Alter, Vollständigkeit, Beschädigung und Gebrauchsspuren eines Objekts.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="abgebrochen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0001</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0001</p><p>Spellings (1): abgeprochens</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="alt" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0003</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0003</p><p>Spellings (14): alti, altem, allte, Alte, altz, alter, allter, allts, allten, alts, allt, altes, alten, ȧlter</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="angebrochen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0006</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0006</p><p>Spellings (1): on prŭech</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="benutzt" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0008"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0008</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0008</p><p>Spellings (1): genütz</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="der nicht verderben kann" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0013</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0013</p><p>Spellings (1): der nit verderben kan</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="durch den Rost fast verdorben" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0014"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0014</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0014</p><p>Spellings (1): dŭrch den rosst vast verdorben</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="erfallen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0017"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0017</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0017</p><p>Spellings (1): ervallen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="fertig" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/