uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00051</p><p>Spellings (27): ettwas vergult, nicht vergŭlt, vergulte, halbe vergult, vergŭlte, vergŭlter, vergullt, vergŭldter, vergúlt, vergults, vergult, vergũlts, nicht vergŭldt, vergultn, nit vergult, verguldt, halb verguld, vergulten, vergulcz, halb vergult, vergŭldts, verguld, halber vergult, vergŭlts, vergŭlt …</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="versilbern" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00052"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_processing:00052</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00052</p><p>Spellings (1): versilberter</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="Symbolische Objekte" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000021"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000021</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000021</p><p>Definition: This term classifies identifiable symbols and/or any aggregation of symbols, that have an objectively recognizable structure and that are documented as single units (sets or arrays of signs). Symbolic objects may serve to designate something, or to communicate some propositional content, but they don’t depend on what they designate or communicate. They can exist on one or more carriers simultaneously without this feature adding to or removing from the identity of the symbols. Being objectively recognizable and documented as single units, symbolic objects are independent of the material carrier and the symbolized content as well. Consequently symbolic objects may or may not have a specific meaning.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;information objects &quot;,&quot;structural parts of information objects&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Aufbau des Dokuments" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000003</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000003</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Absätze" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000015"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000015</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000015</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="beigelegter Bericht" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000016"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000016</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000016</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="beigelegter Brief" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000017"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000017</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000017</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="beigelegtes Blatt" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000018"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000018</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000018</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Eschatokoll" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000019</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000019</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Nachträge" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000021"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000021</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000021</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Protokoll" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000022"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000022</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000022</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Sammelmappe" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000020"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000020</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000020</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Subinventar" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000023"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000023</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000023</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="Beglaubigung" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000005"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000005</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000005</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Chirograph" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000031"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000031</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000031</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Siegel" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000030"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000030</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000030</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Unterschrift" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000032"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000032</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000032</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="Innere Ordnung der Einträge" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000004</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000004</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="graphische Zeichen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000027"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000027</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000027</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Hervorhebungen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000024"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000024</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000024</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Layout/Strukturierung" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000029"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000029</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000029</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Linien" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000025"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000025</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000025</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Spalten" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000028"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000028</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000028</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Überschriften" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000026"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000026</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000026</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="Überlieferungsform" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000002"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000002</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000002</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Abschrift" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000012"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000012</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000012</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Ausfertigung" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000013</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000013</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Konzept" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000014"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000014</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000014</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node></node><node TEXT="Materialien" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000003</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000003</p><p>Definition: Ce terme désigne les types de substances physiques qui composent les objets matériels ou sont utilisées dans leur fabrication mais dont la substance individuelle n'est pas un facteur déterminant de la fonction de l'objet (par exemple, or, eau, brique etc.). La facette peut inclure les matières premières, transformées ou non, mais aussi les matériaux qui ont été façonnés et intégrés dans des objets. Leur attribut principal est qu'ils ne peuvent pas être individualisés c'est à dire qu'ils ne sont pas des unités aux frontières ou aux rôles clairs et distincts par rapport à des unités d'une nature identique ou différente.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="anorganisches Material" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000002"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000002</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000002</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Edelmetal" FOLDED="true" 