, woll, wȗllen, wȗllin, wůllin</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 14 Einträge in 8 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Ziegenschmalz" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001100"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001100</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001100</p><p>Broader concepts: Tierisches Material | tierische Lebensmittel</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="Papier" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_m:000083"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_m:000083</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_m:000083</p><p>Spellings (8): papiereins, papiery̑, papierens, papirin, papieren, pappieri, papiren, papirïn</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 19 Einträge in 14 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="Materielle Objekte" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000004</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000004</p><p>Definition: This term classifies things with physical substance that constitute complete units and have a relatively stable form with identifiable boundaries in at least one dimension. Such units can be natural or man-made (with regard to origin), simple or complex (with regard to composition) or consist of parts. In this latter case it is possible that the parts are either distinct and independent from the unit of which they are a part (e.g. a cave on a mountain) or that they have to be defined with reference to the sum of the parts (e.g. chess-chessmen).</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Gebaute Umgebung" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000018"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000018</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000018</p><p>Definition: Este conceito classifica as estruturas, simples ou complexas, independentemente do seu tamanho, duração de construção ou uso, fixadas ou embutidas no solo e que não podem ser movidas sem danos irreversíveis.

Exemplos de conceitos subordinados: “construções individuais”, “complexos”, “infraestrutura”, “áreas residenciais”.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;single built works&quot;, &quot;complexes&quot;, &quot;infrastructure&quot;, &quot;residential areas&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Außenraum" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000120"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000120</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000120</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Acker" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001313"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001313</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001313</p><p>Spellings (5): agkerli, agker, akher, egcker, ackhele</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 7 Einträge in 4 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Anger" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001314"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001314</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001314</p><p>Definition: grasbewachsenes Wiesen- / Weidestück zur Viehweidung und Heugewinnung</p><p>Spellings (4): annger, angerl, angerle, ăngerl</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 12 Einträge in 3 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Beunde" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001329"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001329</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001329</p><p>Definition: eingezäuntes Grundstück für die Eigennutzung</p><p>Spellings (1): peŭntten</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 8 Einträge in 1 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Brunnen" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000102"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000102</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000102</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Garten" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000043"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000043</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000043</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Gewölbe  ↗" COLOR="#808080" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000021"><font ITALIC="true" NAME="SansSerif" SIZE="12"/><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>Polyhierarchy – narrower concepts under: Materielle Objekte › Gebaute Umgebung › Räume und Bereiche</p><p>ID: inv_r:000021</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000021</p><p>Broader concepts: Räume und Bereiche | Außenraum</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Graben" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000160"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000160</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000160</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Hof" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000023"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000023</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000023</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Kräutergarten" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001436"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001436</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001436</p><p>Definition: eingefriedeter Gemüse- oder Kohlgarten</p><p>Spellings (4): kraw̆tt gartten, crautgartn, crawt gartn, craŭtgartn</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 5 Einträge in 3 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Krautgarten" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000111"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000111</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000111</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Mahd" LINK="https://w3id.org/uib